config TI_C7X_CLEC
	bool "TI C7x CLEC interrupt controller driver"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_TI_C7X_CLEC_ENABLED
	help
	  Driver for the C7x Compute-cluster Local Event Controller (CLEC),
	  which maps K3 system-level events onto the C7x core's 64 internal
	  event lines. Every hardware interrupt on the C7x arrives through it.
